window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Who is Constantine, king of dragon kings? It’s a question asked by many. Con is an enigma. Extremely private, he keeps the details of his past secret. Now is your chance to get a glimpse into certain times of his life and the people he encounters that change him.</p> <p>This audiobook includes three short stories involving Constantine from<i> The New York Times</i> best-selling Dark Kings series from Donna Grant.</p>"; 
